  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/925/244/wardens_plus_logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2026\" height=\"370\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/925/258/2024-07-26_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1200\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/925/243/2024-07-25_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1200\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/925/242/2024-07-25_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;andale mono&#x27;, monospace;font-size:14px\">[Мод]</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;andale mono&#x27;, monospace;font-size:14px\">- Allows warden to render armor and items not normally rendered by default. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;andale mono&#x27;, monospace\"> - You can craft a special chestplate from \"warden heart,\" which wardens drop. When you wear it, you can unleash sonic booms at entities within your line of sight.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;andale mono&#x27;, monospace;font-size:14px\"> - There's a small chance that wardens will spawn holding an iron sword, axe, shield, Totem of Undying, iron armor, gold armor, or leather armor.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;andale mono&#x27;, monospace;font-size:14px\"> - Wardens cause camera shake when they roar, dig, or emerge.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;andale mono&#x27;, monospace;font-size:14px\"> - Wards the warden's walking animation to be more realistic and improved.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;andale mono&#x27;, monospace;font-size:14px\">Enjoy!</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;andale mono&#x27;, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Also check out my other mod linked here:</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;andale mono&#x27;, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/salmons-genesis-reincarnation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/salmons-genesis-reincarnation</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;andale mono&#x27;, monospace;font-size:14px\">If you liked this project, feel free to join our Discord server.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;andale mono&#x27;, monospace;font-size:14px\">Link: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/XFfUjwD6xa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/XFfUjwD6xa</a></span></p>",
